  "description": "<p>As a \"fedoraAdmin\" user I carefully set up a container to which I granted permission for a named \"fedoraUser\" user to read and write.  That user would seem to be able to do whatever they want within that container, except that they can't perform sparql updates with new namespace prefixes.</p>",
